        <body>
            <div xml:id="d604-a2">

                <pb facs="1231" n="1209" xml:id="pg1209"/>

                <head>Annex A—Part II</head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Draft Reply to President From Prime Minister</hi>
                </p>
                <p>I have received your letter of . . . . . . . . . . . and on behalf of the
                    Government of the United Kingdom I take note of and accept the determination and
                    declaration which you have made under the Fourth Provision of the Articles of
                    Agreement governing collaboration between the authorities of the United States
                    of America and the United Kingdom in the matter of Tube Alloys signed by
                    President Roosevelt and Mr. Winston Churchill at Quebec on August 19th,
                    1943.</p>
            </div>
